{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123919","id":4663862388,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFfzkdA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123919","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123919.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123919.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123919","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123919/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123919/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123919/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/14014b4bf7a0fbd74afb8b6d8e209c5f4cd5e3de","number":123919,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix VisualShader unit tests not running by converting test file to header","user":{"login":"suhanemathur","id":105965464,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlDnmA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105965464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/suhanemathur","html_url":"https://github.com/suhanemathur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suhanemathur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suhanemathur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suhanemathur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suhanemathur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suhanemathur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suhanemathur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suhanemathur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suhanemathur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suhanemathur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Unit tests in modules/visual_shader/tests/ were being skipped entirely during --test runs.\r\n\r\n## Description & Solution\r\n\r\ntest_visual_shader.cpp was a .cpp file using TEST_FORCE_LINK, but Godot's module test runner only collects tests from modules/*/tests/*.h headers into modules_tests.gen.h, which is why this file never got compiled in.\r\n\r\n**Changes made:**\r\n- Renamed it to test_visual_shader.h\r\n- wrapped it in namespace TestVisualShader\r\n- added #pragma once, and removed the outdated TEST_FORCE_LINK.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n### Test Output Verification\r\n\r\n- **Before:** `test cases: 0 | 0 passed | 0 failed | 1432 skipped`\r\n- **After:** `test cases: 3 | 3 passed | 0 failed | 1429 skipped` (`103 assertions passed`)\r\n\r\nUse of AI: AI was used to check my understanding of Godot's module test infrastructure. It did not write the code.\r\n\r\nFixes  #123904\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"l